trol falling blocks and try to connect blocks of the same type to create combos, earning the highest score and completing the level objectives. Travel in time and solve the tower puzzles in many ancient and historic locations, including Babylon itself, the Colosseum in Rome, mystical Stonehenge, and many more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong> - 20 levels that reward stars and scores, telling the epic tale of the towers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless</strong> - play any unlocked level, trying to beat the last high score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duel</strong> - play against a friend in a local splitscreen match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sprint</strong> - earn a high score in a sequence of 5 back-to-back consecutive levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marathon</strong> - earn a high score in a sequence of 10  back-to-back consecutive levels.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Wise Up Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709030/2c3e5d725ade9ac8300faa9e1c3ead723904b2e1/header.jpg?t=1760602494","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3709030/596872196/1c2e1b5f88c6645d41704938f2818a9180a2ccdb/1755107969/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755111433","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3709030/596872196/1c2e1b5f88c6645d41704938f2818a9180a2ccdb/1755107969/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755111433","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3709030/596872196/1c